1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:15,000
<font color="#FF8040">{\an8}Downloaded From MoviesMod.Org</font>

2
00:00:28,778 --> 00:00:29,612
Alex.

3
00:00:30,113 --> 00:00:30,989
Jackie?

4
00:00:32,198 --> 00:00:34,784
'Yong nangyari no'ng isang gabi,
di na mauulit 'yon.

5
00:00:34,868 --> 00:00:35,702
Oo,

6
00:00:35,785 --> 00:00:38,872
siguro bugso lang 'yon ng damdamin.

7
00:00:38,955 --> 00:00:39,789
Oo,

8
00:00:40,290 --> 00:00:43,209
kaya kalimutan na lang natin 'yon. Okay?

9
00:00:43,293 --> 00:00:44,878
Oo.

10
00:00:45,587 --> 00:00:47,630
Di na 'yon mauulit…

11
00:00:53,720 --> 00:00:57,307
-Ayun 'yong tinutukoy kong di na mauulit.
-Okay.

12
00:00:58,808 --> 00:01:01,144
Magpe-prepare na 'ko. May pasok pa 'ko.

13
00:01:02,562 --> 00:01:04,314
Oo, ako rin.

14
00:01:25,794 --> 00:01:26,753
-Hi.
-Hi.

15
00:01:26,836 --> 00:01:29,464
-Good morning. Sakto.
-French toast ulit?

16
00:01:29,547 --> 00:01:31,966
Di ba dapat
nakaalis na kayo ngayon ni Alex?

17
00:01:32,050 --> 00:01:34,511
Thank you for asking. Ikaw naman, Nathan,

18
00:01:34,594 --> 00:01:37,889
bumangon ka nang maaga
at magluto ng almusal para sa lahat,

19
00:01:37,972 --> 00:01:40,850
para makain mo 'yong gusto mo.

20
00:01:41,351 --> 00:01:43,186
Sarap! French toast ulit.

21
00:01:43,269 --> 00:01:44,729
-Ganyan nga.
-Thanks.

22
00:01:44,813 --> 00:01:45,980
You're welcome.

23
00:01:46,064 --> 00:01:46,898
Good morning.

24
00:01:46,981 --> 00:01:49,526
Good morning.
Nga pala, nakita mo ba si Alex?

25
00:01:49,609 --> 00:01:52,612
Ihahatid ko pa siya sa rodeo.
Pareho na kaming male-late.

26
00:01:52,695 --> 00:01:55,990
Ako? Hindi, matagal ko
na siyang di nakikita.

27
00:01:58,535 --> 00:02:00,703
Nandiyan ka na pala!
Sumakay ka na sa kotse.

28
00:02:00,787 --> 00:02:03,331
Okay. Nathan, ikaw ang nakatoka
sa dishwashing duty.

29
00:02:03,414 --> 00:02:05,834
Ikaw ang maghahatid sa mga bata.
Jackie, paki…

30
00:02:05,917 --> 00:02:07,210
-…Ready 'yong mga lunch?
-Oo.

31
00:02:07,293 --> 00:02:08,169
-Salamat.
-Ako na.

32
00:02:08,253 --> 00:02:09,337
Okay.

33
00:02:09,420 --> 00:02:11,047
Bye, guys. Have a good day.

34
00:02:11,756 --> 00:02:15,426
Jackie, may meeting pa
sina Cole at Ms. Jacobs, so aalis na tayo…

35
00:02:15,510 --> 00:02:16,636
Oo, sige.

36
00:02:17,303 --> 00:02:20,723
Ako na diyan. Lumakad na kayo.
Naka-apron pa naman ako.

37
00:02:21,683 --> 00:02:23,518
Have a good day. Mag-aral nang mabuti.

38
00:02:23,601 --> 00:02:26,312
Benny, Jordan, Parker,
five minutes na lang, aalis na tayo.

39
00:02:34,237 --> 00:02:36,322
Sinabing maaga tayong aalis ngayon, eh.

40
00:02:41,786 --> 00:02:43,872
-Dito ka na sa harap.
-Mas mahaba ang legs mo.

41
00:02:43,955 --> 00:02:48,042
Kayo lagi ang pinakamaaga, pero
ang bagal n'yo ngayong nagmamadali ako.

42
00:02:48,126 --> 00:02:49,878
Lalo tayong male-late sa ginagawa mo.

43
00:03:02,015 --> 00:03:03,683
Good morning. Pasok.

44
00:03:05,894 --> 00:03:09,314
Upo ka. Ngayon mo pa lang
yata ako kakausapin, ah?

45
00:03:09,397 --> 00:03:12,901
Nakakaintriga tuloy.
Tungkol ba 'to sa probation mo?

46
00:03:12,984 --> 00:03:16,946
Hindi, patapos na ako do'n,
ilang oras na community service na lang.

47
00:03:17,030 --> 00:03:19,908
Good. Maraming hiningan ng tulong si Coach

48
00:03:19,991 --> 00:03:22,410
para di kayo ma-suspend ni Dylan.

49
00:03:22,493 --> 00:03:23,328
Alam ko po.

50
00:03:24,329 --> 00:03:28,124
Gusto ko pong pag-usapan
'yong college application ko.

51
00:03:29,959 --> 00:03:31,377
Okay 'yan, Cole.

52
00:03:32,128 --> 00:03:34,797
Sige, bubuksan ko lang 'yong files mo.

53
00:03:37,175 --> 00:03:39,010
Okay ang summer school performance mo.

54
00:03:39,093 --> 00:03:42,805
-Nag-take ka na pala ng SAT?
-Opo.

55
00:03:42,889 --> 00:03:45,266
May naiisip ka na bang applyan?

56
00:03:45,850 --> 00:03:49,562
Well, interesado ako sa coaching programs.

57
00:03:49,646 --> 00:03:53,399
So schools na may ganoong major
ang target ko.

58
00:03:55,985 --> 00:03:58,947
May ilang schools
na magaganda ang coaching programs.

59
00:03:59,030 --> 00:04:02,116
Halos pare-pareho ang minimum
GPA requirement nila.

60
00:04:02,200 --> 00:04:04,369
Bale ang GPA mo…

61
00:04:09,791 --> 00:04:12,585
Tumaas ang score mo
dahil sa summer school,

62
00:04:13,586 --> 00:04:15,797
pero dahil sa mga nangyari
no'ng junior ka,

63
00:04:15,880 --> 00:04:18,758
baka mahirapan kang makapasok
sa schools na 'yon.

64
00:04:18,841 --> 00:04:22,929
So, sa lala ng ginawa ko sa sarili ko,
di na ulit ako makakabawi?

65
00:04:23,012 --> 00:04:24,472
Hindi, Cole, di 'yon gano'n.

66
00:04:25,431 --> 00:04:29,352
Hintayin muna natin ang SAT scores
at first semester grades mo.

67
00:04:29,435 --> 00:04:32,438
Malaking tulong
kung mapapataas mo pa ang score mo.

68
00:04:33,648 --> 00:04:35,525
Di ba, galawang Cole Walter 'yon?

69
00:04:37,277 --> 00:04:38,194
Di na ngayon.

70
00:04:40,238 --> 00:04:41,614
Salamat, Miss Jacobs.

71
00:04:48,663 --> 00:04:50,957
-Late ka na.
-Oo, sorry…

72
00:04:51,040 --> 00:04:53,710
Akala ko ba okay tayo?
Kung di ka sigurado…

73
00:04:53,793 --> 00:04:56,587
Hindi nga. Seryoso ako. Okay tayo.

74
00:04:56,671 --> 00:04:59,590
-Alin ang kabayo ko?
-'Yong fourth dapat ang pipiliin mo.

75
00:04:59,674 --> 00:05:02,802
Di pwedeng coach ang mamili,
so 'yong naiwan ang napunta sa 'yo.

76
00:05:02,885 --> 00:05:04,345
-Hulaan mo.
-Wag mo nang sabihin.

77
00:05:04,429 --> 00:05:06,180
-True North.
-'Yong nakapatay ng tao?

78
00:05:06,264 --> 00:05:09,267
Tsismis lang 'yon,
pero dapat focused ka pa rin bukas.

79
00:05:09,350 --> 00:05:13,104
-Baka ikaw ang una niyang mapatay.
-Pangako, 100% focused ako bukas.

80
00:05:13,688 --> 00:05:14,814
Wag ka nang mag-alala.

81
00:05:25,533 --> 00:05:26,951
Tanggalin mo na 'yan.

82
00:05:27,035 --> 00:05:28,244
Ayoko nga.

83
00:05:28,328 --> 00:05:30,747
Gagawin ko 'yang
"Student Body President" next year.

84
00:05:30,830 --> 00:05:34,500
-Nakakaloka, si Paige ang nanalo.
-Malay n'yo nagbago na siya.

85
00:05:34,584 --> 00:05:39,213
Sa ngayon, ang nagagawa niya pa lang,
mag-request ng designated parking slots.

86
00:05:40,840 --> 00:05:43,092
Gusto ko lang ng pagbabago.

87
00:05:43,176 --> 00:05:46,721
Nag-email ako kay Paige ng future projects

88
00:05:46,804 --> 00:05:50,433
gaya ng tutoring programs,
pagdalo sa PTA meetings,

89
00:05:50,516 --> 00:05:52,727
pero di siya sumagot.

90
00:05:52,810 --> 00:05:54,937
Anong project
ang gusto mong gawin kung sakali?

91
00:05:55,021 --> 00:05:59,734
Gusto kong i-improve ang college fair
para maraming bumisitang college reps,

92
00:05:59,817 --> 00:06:02,695
at mag-invite ng vocational schools
para sa ayaw mag-college.

93
00:06:02,779 --> 00:06:05,865
Pwede mo namang gawin 'yon.
Kukumbinsihin mo lang si Ms. Jacobs.

94
00:06:05,948 --> 00:06:08,910
Kahit di po ako
ang nanalong junior class president…

95
00:06:08,993 --> 00:06:11,329
-Gusto ko sanang 'yong college fair…
-Yes.

96
00:06:11,412 --> 00:06:13,873
-Ano pong yes?
-Yes, tulungan mo ako sa college fair.

97
00:06:13,956 --> 00:06:15,750
Malaking bagay nga kung tutulong ka,

98
00:06:15,833 --> 00:06:18,961
saka parang di ako makakakain
hangga't di ako umooo sa 'yo.

99
00:06:19,045 --> 00:06:19,879
Ayos.

100
00:06:22,840 --> 00:06:23,841
May isa pa po pala.

101
00:06:25,134 --> 00:06:27,970
Pakitanong po sana sa reps
kung pwedeng din silang

102
00:06:28,054 --> 00:06:30,681
magpa-one-on-one meetings,
o mini interviews,

103
00:06:30,765 --> 00:06:34,060
para sa mga walang kakayanang
bumisita sa campus.

104
00:06:34,143 --> 00:06:37,522
Kung matatantiya mo
kung ilan ang interesado diyan,

105
00:06:37,605 --> 00:06:39,857
pwede ko 'yong itanong sa college reps.

106
00:06:39,941 --> 00:06:42,443
-Aasikasuhin ko na po 'yan.
-Alam ko naman.

107
00:06:44,112 --> 00:06:45,863
-Salamat.
-You're welcome.

108
00:06:45,947 --> 00:06:48,366
-Isasara ko na po 'yong pinto.
-Thank you.

109
00:06:53,287 --> 00:06:58,000
INTERESADO KA BA SA COLLEGE FAIR?
ONE-ON-ONE INTERVIEWS

110
00:07:04,715 --> 00:07:05,591
Ako na diyan.

111
00:07:10,513 --> 00:07:14,600
Okay, may drummer na 'tong bandang 'to.

112
00:07:15,685 --> 00:07:16,811
Luma na 'to.

113
00:07:17,979 --> 00:07:20,106
No'ng nakaraan pa 'tong Homecoming Huddle,

114
00:07:20,189 --> 00:07:21,524
at…

115
00:07:23,443 --> 00:07:24,318
ayan na.

116
00:07:33,453 --> 00:07:35,538
Gusto mo bang magpalista?

117
00:07:37,498 --> 00:07:38,332
Hindi.

118
00:07:39,333 --> 00:07:40,209
Okay lang ako.

119
00:08:07,361 --> 00:08:10,948
Akala ko sa kabila ka dumaan.

120
00:08:11,032 --> 00:08:13,701
Madalas doon ako dumadaan.

121
00:08:13,784 --> 00:08:15,995
Pero naisip kong baka doon ka dumaan.

122
00:08:16,078 --> 00:08:21,000
-Dapat nga doon ako dumaan…
-Ako dapat ang dumaan doon…

123
00:08:34,972 --> 00:08:37,808
Sorry, di ko sinasadya…

124
00:08:37,892 --> 00:08:39,268
Sinadya ko 'yon.

125
00:08:40,895 --> 00:08:44,148
Dahil simula kahapon,
'yon lang ang laman ng isip ko.

126
00:08:44,232 --> 00:08:45,066
So…

127
00:09:15,513 --> 00:09:16,389
Uy.

128
00:09:16,889 --> 00:09:17,932
Uy.

129
00:09:18,015 --> 00:09:20,101
-Ginawa 'to ni Parker para sa 'yo.
-Talaga?

130
00:09:20,184 --> 00:09:22,603
-Pampasuwerte.
-Grabe, ang sweet niya.

131
00:09:25,064 --> 00:09:27,191
Tandaan mo, dapat mag-focus kang mabuti.

132
00:09:27,275 --> 00:09:29,360
Ang hirap na nga
dahil di ka umabot sa draw.

133
00:09:29,443 --> 00:09:32,822
So bawal ka na talagang
magkamali at ma-distract.

134
00:09:32,905 --> 00:09:34,198
Wag kang mag-alala.

135
00:09:34,282 --> 00:09:36,951
Di ako magkakamali at madi-distract.

136
00:09:37,702 --> 00:09:39,370
Siguruhin mo lang.

137
00:09:39,453 --> 00:09:44,125
Nangako ako sa nanay mong di ka mamamatay
dahil ayaw niya pang mawala ka.

138
00:09:45,960 --> 00:09:49,088
Okay, magpapasalamat lang ako kay Parker
bago tayo umalis.

139
00:09:53,926 --> 00:09:56,095
Tinulungan ko si Parker diyan,

140
00:09:56,178 --> 00:09:58,681
so good luck charm ko din 'yan
para sa 'yo.

141
00:10:00,266 --> 00:10:02,768
Sa tono mo, parang di ka pupunta, ah?

142
00:10:03,561 --> 00:10:06,981
Di nga. Ayokong ma-distract
at masaktan ka dahil sa 'kin.

143
00:10:07,064 --> 00:10:10,401
-Gusto kong nando'n ka.
-Tama si Blake. Dapat naka-focus ka.

144
00:10:10,484 --> 00:10:12,987
Sige, kung 'yon
ang sa tingin mong makakabuti.

145
00:10:13,070 --> 00:10:14,614
'Yon ang makakabuti.

146
00:10:22,079 --> 00:10:25,750
Magpapalit lang ako ng pang-rodeo outfit
tapos aalis na tayo.

147
00:10:25,833 --> 00:10:26,959
Okay, sige lang.

148
00:10:28,961 --> 00:10:30,630
-Honey.
-Ano 'yon?

149
00:10:30,713 --> 00:10:33,716
Uy. Di mapapa'no si Alex.

150
00:10:33,799 --> 00:10:36,510
Oo naman. Nag-training siyang mabuti,

151
00:10:36,594 --> 00:10:39,764
saka magaling si Blake.
Safety ang priority niya.

152
00:10:39,847 --> 00:10:41,682
-Pero ikaw…
-Kinakabahan ako.

153
00:10:41,766 --> 00:10:42,642
Oo, alam ko.

154
00:10:43,768 --> 00:10:45,061
Kasama mo naman ako.

155
00:10:45,144 --> 00:10:49,106
-Magkasama tayong kakabahan.
-Magiging maayos ang lahat.

156
00:10:50,191 --> 00:10:51,067
Pasok.

157
00:10:52,276 --> 00:10:54,612
Hi, sorry. Alam kong Sabado ngayon.

158
00:10:54,695 --> 00:10:57,990
Papunta kami sa rodeo ni Alex.
May problema ba?

159
00:10:58,074 --> 00:11:00,451
May problema sa farm zoning.

160
00:11:00,534 --> 00:11:03,663
Dahil do'n kaya di tayo magka-permit.
Walang magawa 'yong contact ko.

161
00:11:03,746 --> 00:11:07,208
-Baka pwedeng sa Lunes na 'to?
-Di pwede. Kaya lang 'to posibleng maayos

162
00:11:07,291 --> 00:11:09,919
dahil Sabado ngayon.
Di uubra kung sa Lunes pa.

163
00:11:12,296 --> 00:11:14,423
Sige, ako na lang ang aalis.
Dito ka na lang

164
00:11:14,507 --> 00:11:15,800
-Ano? Di pwede.
-Ayos lang.

165
00:11:15,883 --> 00:11:18,969
-Okay lang. Babalitaan na lang kita.
-Ayokong palagpasin 'to.

166
00:11:19,053 --> 00:11:21,305
Alam ko, pero importante 'to.

167
00:11:25,643 --> 00:11:27,770
Sige, ite-text ko na lang si Alex.

168
00:11:31,399 --> 00:11:35,403
Pag nakita mo siya,
pakisabing sinusuportahan ko siya.

169
00:11:35,486 --> 00:11:36,320
Sige.

170
00:11:38,989 --> 00:11:39,949
Pasensiya ka na.

171
00:11:57,341 --> 00:11:59,301
So part pa rin 'to ng probation natin?

172
00:11:59,385 --> 00:12:02,346
Ang magpulot ng basura
sa harap ng maraming tao.

173
00:12:02,847 --> 00:12:06,183
-Pambihira.
-Last na daw 'to sabi ni Coach.

174
00:12:06,892 --> 00:12:09,061
After nito, absuwelto na raw tayo.

175
00:12:09,145 --> 00:12:10,104
Dapat lang.

176
00:12:12,690 --> 00:12:15,317
-Sa kettle corn ba tayo mag-umpisa?
-Sige, susundan kita.

177
00:12:20,364 --> 00:12:25,911
Hello, fans, friends, at family.
Welcome sa Dubeau Valley Rodeo.

178
00:12:25,995 --> 00:12:29,039
Masaya kaming nandito kayong lahat ngayon.

179
00:12:29,123 --> 00:12:32,293
So tingnan natin kung anong klaseng
audience ang meron tayo.

180
00:12:32,376 --> 00:12:35,212
Okay, mag-ingay kayong lahat.

181
00:12:36,088 --> 00:12:37,465
Ganyan nga.

182
00:12:37,548 --> 00:12:40,843
Nagpapasalamat ang Dubeau Valley
at D.V.R. youth rodeo group

183
00:12:40,926 --> 00:12:44,847
sa pagsuporta n'yo sa Colorado youth.

184
00:12:44,930 --> 00:12:47,558
Maraming-maraming salamat sa suporta n'yo.

185
00:12:50,144 --> 00:12:51,520
Sa 'yo pala si True North?

186
00:12:52,730 --> 00:12:54,857
-Alam mo bang nakapatay siya?
-Di 'yon totoo.

187
00:12:54,940 --> 00:12:55,775
Talaga ba?

188
00:12:56,984 --> 00:12:58,694
Mahirap kontrolin si True North.

189
00:12:58,778 --> 00:13:02,114
Pero basta't naka-focus si Alex,
walang magiging problema.

190
00:13:02,198 --> 00:13:05,075
-Baka talunin ka pa niya, Wylder.
-Malabo 'yan.

191
00:13:05,785 --> 00:13:07,661
Pero excited na 'kong makalaban ka.

192
00:13:07,745 --> 00:13:11,665
Kung totoo 'yong nabanggit sa 'kin
ni Blake, magandang laban 'to.

193
00:13:12,666 --> 00:13:14,043
Enjoy sa ride, Walter.

194
00:13:20,049 --> 00:13:24,220
No'ng sinurvey 'yong nasunog, nalaman
nilang mali ang pagkaka-zone sa rantso,

195
00:13:24,303 --> 00:13:26,931
ibig sabihin
bawal 'tong tayuan ng kahit ano.

196
00:13:27,014 --> 00:13:27,848
-Gano'n?
-Oo.

197
00:13:27,932 --> 00:13:30,559
Pero nakiusap ako sa friend ko
sa permits department.

198
00:13:30,643 --> 00:13:34,104
Kung maibibigay natin
ang rebuilding plans ngayon,

199
00:13:34,188 --> 00:13:35,898
iba-backdate at ia-approve niya 'yon.

200
00:13:38,317 --> 00:13:42,112
Okay. Napag-usapan namin ni Will
'yong expansion plans…

201
00:13:44,406 --> 00:13:47,451
Di pa rin ako sure
kung eto 'yong tamang gawin.

202
00:13:47,535 --> 00:13:50,246
Di dapat 'to madaliin
dahil malaking desisyon 'to.

203
00:13:50,329 --> 00:13:52,748
Dapat magawa na 'to
bago magbukas ang office sa Lunes

204
00:13:52,832 --> 00:13:54,124
para maiwasan ang review.

205
00:13:54,208 --> 00:13:58,170
Malaking tulong 'yong friend niya
dahil pag nagka-official review…

206
00:13:58,254 --> 00:14:00,339
Made-delay na tayo nang sobra-sobra.

207
00:14:03,384 --> 00:14:05,302
May isa pa.

208
00:14:06,762 --> 00:14:09,265
Dahil iba-backdate niya 'yong permits,

209
00:14:09,348 --> 00:14:12,726
dapat masimulan na ang paghuhukay
bago magkatapusan.

210
00:14:12,810 --> 00:14:15,187
-Bago magkatapusan?
-Kaya natin 'yon.

211
00:14:15,271 --> 00:14:16,814
Madali lang 'yon.

212
00:14:16,897 --> 00:14:19,525
Di birong changes 'tong gagawin natin.

213
00:14:19,608 --> 00:14:23,404
Dapat plantsahin muna natin 'to,
at siguruhing pabor sa 'tin 'to.

214
00:14:23,487 --> 00:14:25,698
Parang ang bilis ng mga nangyayari.

215
00:14:25,781 --> 00:14:28,659
Pag-iisipan ko muna 'to,
at pag-uusapan namin 'to ni Katherine.

216
00:14:28,742 --> 00:14:29,577
Okay.

217
00:14:31,203 --> 00:14:32,872
-Mag-break muna tayo.
-Oo.

218
00:14:34,540 --> 00:14:38,752
Di ako papayag na madaliin n'yo ako
sa pagdedesisyon

219
00:14:38,836 --> 00:14:40,754
dahil lang may aberya sa permit.

220
00:14:40,838 --> 00:14:42,047
Di ko 'to mamadaliin.

221
00:14:42,131 --> 00:14:45,342
Titingnan muna namin ang options namin
bago tayo maghukay.

222
00:14:57,646 --> 00:15:01,775
Kung interviewhin ko kaya
'yong ilan sa reps,

223
00:15:02,401 --> 00:15:05,696
para malaman natin
'yong mga hinahanap ng universities.

224
00:15:05,779 --> 00:15:06,614
Salamat.

225
00:15:08,073 --> 00:15:10,159
Para akong nakikipag-usap sa pader.

226
00:15:12,161 --> 00:15:15,539
Okay 'yong naisip mo. Pakiulit lang.

227
00:15:15,623 --> 00:15:18,542
'Ka ko, pwedeng interviewhin
ng newspaper club 'yong reps.

228
00:15:18,626 --> 00:15:20,711
Matutuwa ang juniors at seniors…

229
00:15:20,794 --> 00:15:25,799
…eto na si Wylder Holt, ang three-time
winner natin. Mahusay siyang rider.

230
00:15:33,766 --> 00:15:36,644
May um-order ba ng cheap white wine
na naka-plastic cup?

231
00:15:36,727 --> 00:15:39,021
Oo, ako.

232
00:15:39,647 --> 00:15:40,481
Salamat.

233
00:15:41,106 --> 00:15:43,651
Thank you, pumunta ka
kahit late na kita nasabihan.

234
00:15:44,360 --> 00:15:47,196
Baka masuka ako sa kaba
kung mag-isa ko siyang papanoorin.

235
00:15:47,279 --> 00:15:50,366
Hindi, ayos lang.
Okay ring makalabas kahit minsan.

236
00:15:50,449 --> 00:15:51,659
Kumusta kayo ni Bob?

237
00:15:54,244 --> 00:15:57,998
Paki-explain na lang 'tong event sa 'kin.

238
00:15:58,082 --> 00:16:00,125
Well, simple lang 'to.

239
00:16:00,626 --> 00:16:04,129
Pagbukas ng gate,
may lalabas na galit na bucking horse

240
00:16:04,213 --> 00:16:05,756
na pupunta sa arena

241
00:16:05,839 --> 00:16:08,842
para ihulog ang rider
habang nakakapit ang rider

242
00:16:09,593 --> 00:16:10,761
gamit ang isang kamay.

243
00:16:11,428 --> 00:16:14,098
Nakakaloka, di ba?
Lalo na para sa mga nanay.

244
00:16:15,015 --> 00:16:19,395
Eto na si Wylder Holt, ang three-time
winner natin. Mahusay siyang rider.

245
00:16:20,562 --> 00:16:25,359
Bukas na ang gate.
Kalmadong-kalmado si Wylder.

246
00:16:25,985 --> 00:16:28,862
Ayan na siya.

247
00:16:30,698 --> 00:16:35,077
Ibang klaseng ride 'yon, Wylder.
Nabuo ni Wylder Holt ang eight seconds.

248
00:16:35,160 --> 00:16:37,538
-Wow.
-Almost perfect ride 'yon.

249
00:16:38,080 --> 00:16:41,417
Naka-83 points si Wylder Holt.

250
00:16:41,500 --> 00:16:42,835
Ang galing.

251
00:16:43,961 --> 00:16:46,005
-Magaling nga ba 'yon?
-Oo.

252
00:16:46,088 --> 00:16:47,756
-Medyo.
-So 'yon…

253
00:16:47,840 --> 00:16:49,591
…'Yon ang kalaban ni Alex.

254
00:16:51,802 --> 00:16:56,181
Palakpakan nating lahat si Wylder Holt!

255
00:16:58,267 --> 00:17:02,146
Sasalang na si Alex Walter,
sakay ni True North para sa round one.

256
00:17:02,229 --> 00:17:06,442
Lumaban ako dito last week.
Malambot 'yong lupa kaya ingat ka.

257
00:17:06,525 --> 00:17:09,611
Wag mong kokontrahin 'yong kabayo
kahit parang malalaglag ka na.

258
00:17:10,696 --> 00:17:11,697
Kaya mo 'yan.

259
00:17:14,199 --> 00:17:16,076
-At siyempre…
-Kaya ko 'to.

260
00:17:16,160 --> 00:17:19,038
…maraming salamat sa Rescue Rangers.

261
00:17:19,121 --> 00:17:22,166
Palakpakan natin ang mga pickup rider.

262
00:17:22,249 --> 00:17:23,667
Tagdalawang drinks tayo.

263
00:17:24,752 --> 00:17:26,545
Ang bait mo talagang kaibigan.

264
00:17:27,296 --> 00:17:29,298
-Salamat. Kaibigan nga kita.
-Okay.

265
00:17:29,381 --> 00:17:32,551
Sasakay na si Alex Walter kay True North.

266
00:17:39,683 --> 00:17:40,684
Unang beses sasabak

267
00:17:40,768 --> 00:17:43,145
ng batang Walter sa Saddle Bronc Event,

268
00:17:43,228 --> 00:17:46,440
pero maganda ang performance niya
sa Extreme Cowboy Event.

269
00:17:51,445 --> 00:17:52,279
Okay.

270
00:17:57,451 --> 00:17:59,161
Ayan na siya.

271
00:17:59,244 --> 00:18:02,873
Mahirap kontrolin si True North.
Siya ang pinakamalakas pumiglas.

272
00:18:03,999 --> 00:18:06,335
Gumigewang si Walter.

273
00:18:07,753 --> 00:18:08,587
Susmaryosep.

274
00:18:13,217 --> 00:18:14,593
Tapos na ang ride.

275
00:18:14,676 --> 00:18:17,513
Di nakakapit nang mahigpit
si Alex Walter sa round one.

276
00:18:17,596 --> 00:18:18,806
-Okay lang siya.
-Oo.

277
00:18:18,889 --> 00:18:20,766
-Okay lang siya.
-Kinabahan ako do'n.

278
00:18:22,392 --> 00:18:24,186
Malamang dismayado siya.

279
00:18:29,900 --> 00:18:32,361
Di ko alam na mahilig ka sa rodeo.

280
00:18:33,153 --> 00:18:35,864
Oo, well, karamihan sa tagarito,
mahilig sa rodeo.

281
00:18:35,948 --> 00:18:37,741
So tama lang na magkainteres ako dito.

282
00:18:38,659 --> 00:18:42,162
Kumusta ka nga pala?
Okay ka na ba kay Nathan?

283
00:18:42,246 --> 00:18:43,122
Okay lang ako.

284
00:18:46,875 --> 00:18:49,378
Nalimutan kong kumuha ng asukal.
Sandali lang.

285
00:18:52,673 --> 00:18:54,800
Okay, ano'ng meron?

286
00:18:57,177 --> 00:19:01,014
-Si Alex at ako, alam mo na…
-Nagkabalikan na kayo?

287
00:19:01,098 --> 00:19:03,559
Hindi. Wala lang siguro 'yon.

288
00:19:03,642 --> 00:19:05,269
Wala lang din ba 'yon sa 'yo?

289
00:19:05,352 --> 00:19:09,231
Ewan ko. Ang alam ko,
di ako pwedeng pumunta do'n sa rodeo.

290
00:19:09,314 --> 00:19:10,858
Kailangan niyang mag-focus.

291
00:19:10,941 --> 00:19:13,277
Di ko mapapatawad ang sarili ko
pag napaano siya.

292
00:19:13,944 --> 00:19:14,778
Okay.

293
00:19:14,862 --> 00:19:17,072
Pero ano talaga ang gusto mong gawin?

294
00:19:17,156 --> 00:19:19,992
-Gusto kong pumunta sa rodeo.
-Ano'ng gusto niyang gawin mo?

295
00:19:20,075 --> 00:19:21,702
Gusto niya akong pumunta do'n.

296
00:19:21,785 --> 00:19:26,081
Okay. Kung pareho n'yong gustong
pumunta sa rodeo…

297
00:19:28,750 --> 00:19:29,626
Oh, hello.

298
00:19:31,128 --> 00:19:33,589
Saglit lang naman ako nawala.

299
00:19:33,672 --> 00:19:35,841
I-share n'yo naman sa 'kin 'yan.

300
00:19:36,341 --> 00:19:41,054
Gusto mo ba ng hot cowboys
at unli snacks? Manlilibre ako.

301
00:19:41,138 --> 00:19:42,598
Well, single na 'ko.

302
00:19:43,265 --> 00:19:45,726
Sa totoo lang,
na-excite ako sa hot cowboys.

303
00:19:46,643 --> 00:19:48,896
Sakto, may cute top ako
na gusto kong suotin.

304
00:19:48,979 --> 00:19:50,606
-Taray.
-Tara na ba?

305
00:19:50,689 --> 00:19:51,565
-Oo.
-Taralets.

306
00:19:58,780 --> 00:20:00,699
-Bakit gano'n?
-Alam ko.

307
00:20:00,782 --> 00:20:03,035
Sorry. Ewan ko kung ano'ng nangyari.

308
00:20:03,118 --> 00:20:06,997
Mahirap kontrolin si True North,
pero ngayon ka lang nagkamali nang gano'n.

309
00:20:07,080 --> 00:20:09,791
-Mukhang lumuwag 'yong cinches.
-Dahil ba nandito ako?

310
00:20:09,875 --> 00:20:12,127
Akala ko okay lang
na maging coach mo pa rin ako?

311
00:20:12,211 --> 00:20:13,170
Di 'yon ang problema.

312
00:20:13,253 --> 00:20:14,796
Masaya akong nandito ka.

313
00:20:14,880 --> 00:20:17,758
Sorry, okay?
Di ko alam kung ano'ng nangyari.

314
00:20:18,342 --> 00:20:20,344
Alam mong ramdam ng kabayo ang mood mo.

315
00:20:20,427 --> 00:20:24,264
May isang round ka pa.
Kaya mo ba talagang ibigay ang best mo?

316
00:20:26,308 --> 00:20:27,142
Oo.

317
00:20:27,976 --> 00:20:28,810
Kaya ko.

318
00:20:30,812 --> 00:20:31,813
Okay.

319
00:20:31,897 --> 00:20:34,775
Okay, Tanner Jones na
ang susunod na sasalang.

320
00:20:36,276 --> 00:20:39,863
Ayan na siya. Matibay at matatag siya!

321
00:20:39,947 --> 00:20:41,782
Ang lupit ng cowboy na 'to.

322
00:20:41,865 --> 00:20:45,702
Mag-ingay ang lahat habang umiikot siya.

323
00:20:48,497 --> 00:20:49,748
Sang-ayon ako sa 'yo.

324
00:20:49,831 --> 00:20:52,793
Kung minamadali nila tayo,
dapat lang na kumontra tayo.

325
00:20:54,503 --> 00:20:56,296
Oo, di 'yon ang gusto natin.

326
00:20:57,506 --> 00:21:00,217
Okay. Mamaya natin 'yan pag-usapan.

327
00:21:00,300 --> 00:21:02,844
Bye. Sorry. Si George 'yong tumawag.

328
00:21:02,928 --> 00:21:04,972
Ayos lang.
Naalala kong mahilig ka sa sweet.

329
00:21:05,055 --> 00:21:06,890
-Oo.
-Di ka mahilig sa maalat.

330
00:21:13,689 --> 00:21:15,691
So may isa pang round?

331
00:21:16,233 --> 00:21:18,568
Oo, mapapanood ulit natin si Alex.

332
00:21:20,320 --> 00:21:21,822
Bakit ko ba kasi siya pinayagan?

333
00:21:21,905 --> 00:21:23,949
May anak na naman akong
posibleng masaktan.

334
00:21:24,032 --> 00:21:25,659
Na naman? Si Cole ba?

335
00:21:25,742 --> 00:21:27,703
Two years ago na 'yon.
Di mo kasalanan 'yon.

336
00:21:27,786 --> 00:21:29,746
Pero pinayagan ko siyang mag-ski.

337
00:21:30,539 --> 00:21:32,833
Sana di ko na lang siya pinayagan

338
00:21:32,916 --> 00:21:35,919
o kung sumama sana ako,
baka di siya naaksidente.

339
00:21:36,003 --> 00:21:38,505
Pag nanay ka,
puro guilt at takot ang nasa isip mo.

340
00:21:38,588 --> 00:21:40,132
Oo, at saka labahan.

341
00:21:40,799 --> 00:21:43,010
-Pa'no mo 'yon nagagawa?
-Ang alin?

342
00:21:43,093 --> 00:21:47,055
Hinahayaan mo lang silang
makipagsapalaran at magkamali.

343
00:21:47,139 --> 00:21:49,016
Madalas no choice na ako.

344
00:21:49,099 --> 00:21:52,019
Oo, pero sana ganyan din ako
pagdating kay Grace.

345
00:21:53,645 --> 00:21:55,355
Para kasing ayoko siyang pakawalan.

346
00:21:57,316 --> 00:21:59,901
-Gets kita diyan.
-Kain.

347
00:22:11,371 --> 00:22:14,041
Nakita mo ba 'yong nahulog? Kawawang bata.

348
00:22:14,124 --> 00:22:16,960
Mahilig sumugal si Blake
sa mga tinuturuan niya.

349
00:22:17,044 --> 00:22:20,047
Nag-aksaya lang siya ng oras
sa Alex na 'yon.

350
00:22:20,130 --> 00:22:23,633
Two seconds lang yata
ang best record ng batang 'yon.

351
00:22:24,426 --> 00:22:26,136
Eh si Tanner Jones?

352
00:22:26,720 --> 00:22:31,099
Hoy, Wylder, dahan-dahan ka
sa pananalita mo sa kapatid ko.

353
00:22:31,183 --> 00:22:32,434
Uy, no offense.

354
00:22:32,517 --> 00:22:34,686
Magaling si Alex,
pero kung di siya magbabago,

355
00:22:34,770 --> 00:22:36,438
malala ang sasapitin niya.

356
00:22:36,521 --> 00:22:38,065
Di para sa lahat ang bronc riding.

357
00:22:38,148 --> 00:22:41,360
Okay lang kung pipili siya
ng mas madaling competition.

358
00:22:47,824 --> 00:22:51,203
Kung maghukay man tayo
sa mga susunod na linggo…

359
00:22:51,286 --> 00:22:52,120
Okay.

360
00:22:54,331 --> 00:22:55,415
George.

361
00:22:56,708 --> 00:22:59,961
Ipapaalala ko lang,
di ganito ang nagpagkasunduan natin.

362
00:23:01,004 --> 00:23:05,842
Sabay dapat na nag-o-operate
'yong rantso at project,

363
00:23:05,926 --> 00:23:07,886
pero ang lawak na ng nasakop ng project.

364
00:23:07,969 --> 00:23:10,263
Oo, di eto 'yong unang napagkasunduan,

365
00:23:10,347 --> 00:23:13,475
pero malaki ang potensiyal pag nag-expand.

366
00:23:15,477 --> 00:23:17,979
Pinag-isipan ko 'tong mabuti,

367
00:23:18,063 --> 00:23:20,982
pati na 'yong halaga
ng lupang 'to sa pamilya namin.

368
00:23:21,066 --> 00:23:23,610
Para sa 'kin, hindi eto ang tamang gawin.

369
00:23:24,444 --> 00:23:28,115
Pasensiya na kung gano'n,
pero malaki ang nakasalalay dito.

370
00:23:28,198 --> 00:23:31,326
-Naiintindihan ko.
-Pag di tayo kumilos, kawalan sa 'tin 'to.

371
00:23:31,410 --> 00:23:33,078
Marami nang nawala sa 'kin,

372
00:23:33,161 --> 00:23:36,248
gaya ng barn na naging palaruan ko
at ng mga anak ko.

373
00:23:36,331 --> 00:23:40,752
Nilipat na 'yong shed na tinayo
ng lolo ng lolo ko 100 years ago.

374
00:23:40,836 --> 00:23:44,840
Ngayon, di ko napanood ang first
bronc riding competition ng anak ko.

375
00:23:45,924 --> 00:23:48,176
Ayoko nang madagdagan pa 'yon.

376
00:23:48,260 --> 00:23:51,388
Pa, di natin hahayaang mangyari 'yon.

377
00:23:51,471 --> 00:23:54,266
Property ko 'to.
Ako ang magdedesisyon dito.

378
00:23:56,059 --> 00:23:58,562
Pasensiya na, hanggang dito na lang 'to.

379
00:24:02,399 --> 00:24:04,651
George, didiretsahin na kita.

380
00:24:05,360 --> 00:24:07,112
Gusto ko sanang magkasundo tayo dito.

381
00:24:08,488 --> 00:24:11,032
Pero kung di tayo magkakasundo,

382
00:24:11,116 --> 00:24:14,494
nasa kontrata na ako
ang mamamahala sa project

383
00:24:14,578 --> 00:24:16,246
para sa kapakanan nito.

384
00:24:16,329 --> 00:24:17,205
Ano 'ka mo?

385
00:24:18,331 --> 00:24:19,166
Tama ba 'yon?

386
00:24:19,249 --> 00:24:21,710
Oo. May clause sa kontrata.

387
00:24:24,421 --> 00:24:29,259
Pagdedesisyunan n'yo ang project
at lupa namin nang wala kami?

388
00:24:29,342 --> 00:24:31,178
Oo, pag no choice na ako.

389
00:24:34,389 --> 00:24:38,560
Siguradong nasa kontrata ding originally,
tents lang ang itatayo dito.

390
00:24:38,643 --> 00:24:40,353
So di matibay 'yong kontrata.

391
00:24:40,437 --> 00:24:42,105
Ayokong umabot 'to sa korte.

392
00:24:42,189 --> 00:24:44,608
-Puwes di mo sana ako tinakot.
-Di kita tinakot.

393
00:24:44,691 --> 00:24:49,613
Pa, magtulungan tayo
para makahanap tayo ng solusyon dito.

394
00:24:52,073 --> 00:24:53,700
Makakaalis na kayo.

395
00:25:01,500 --> 00:25:02,334
Alam mo,

396
00:25:03,668 --> 00:25:05,629
masosolusyunan din natin 'to.

397
00:25:15,805 --> 00:25:16,806
Will?

398
00:25:27,526 --> 00:25:29,152
Tatawag na lang ako, Papa.

399
00:25:40,205 --> 00:25:41,122
Wow!

400
00:25:41,706 --> 00:25:42,958
Ang ganda ng view.

401
00:25:43,041 --> 00:25:44,000
Kaya nga, eh.

402
00:25:44,793 --> 00:25:46,711
-Ang cute nila.
-Alam mo ba?

403
00:25:48,505 --> 00:25:51,675
-Sandali lang.
-Go lang. Wag kang magmadali.

404
00:25:51,758 --> 00:25:53,927
Dito lang kami habang umiinom…

405
00:25:54,511 --> 00:25:58,723
Teka. Jackie, pahiram ng jacket, please,
bago pa 'ko makita ni Mama.

406
00:26:00,433 --> 00:26:01,560
Nakita niya na 'ko.

407
00:26:02,644 --> 00:26:05,355
Hayaan mo na.
Pakisabi kay Alex good luck 'ka mo.

408
00:26:05,438 --> 00:26:08,275
Dito lang ako
habang nilalamon ako ng kahihiyan.

409
00:26:12,279 --> 00:26:13,738
-Hi.
-Hi.

410
00:26:14,656 --> 00:26:18,034
-Salamat, pumunta ka.
-Okay lang ba talaga sa 'yo?

411
00:26:18,118 --> 00:26:20,161
Alam kong ayaw mo ng distractions,

412
00:26:20,245 --> 00:26:25,083
pero gusto sana kitang panooring
sumakay sa bronc nang full eight seconds.

413
00:26:25,166 --> 00:26:26,126
Naku,

414
00:26:26,793 --> 00:26:30,171
kung napanood mo 'yong round one,
malamang madismaya ka.

415
00:26:30,672 --> 00:26:33,758
Actually, napanood kita sa live stream.

416
00:26:34,634 --> 00:26:36,136
'Yon ang pinunta ko dito.

417
00:26:37,012 --> 00:26:38,972
Para sabihin sa 'yo

418
00:26:39,848 --> 00:26:41,891
na alam kong magaling kang rider.

419
00:26:42,517 --> 00:26:44,144
Alam kong kaya mo 'to.

420
00:26:45,604 --> 00:26:47,564
Gawin mo lang 'yong normal mong ginagawa.

421
00:26:50,859 --> 00:26:53,528
Ang next, si Alex Walter
para sa second round.

422
00:26:58,408 --> 00:27:02,662
-Di mo ba 'ko sasabihan ng good luck?
-Di mo kailangan no'n. Kaya mo 'to.

423
00:27:10,253 --> 00:27:11,630
May paparating.

424
00:27:12,339 --> 00:27:13,173
Hi.

425
00:27:13,256 --> 00:27:14,966
-Sorry.
-Good to see you.

426
00:27:15,467 --> 00:27:17,761
-Kumusta? Hi.
-Okay lang.

427
00:27:21,806 --> 00:27:22,891
Hi.

428
00:27:25,769 --> 00:27:28,647
-Di ko alam na pupunta si Jackie dito.
-Oo.

429
00:27:29,564 --> 00:27:30,940
Mabuti nga pumunta siya.

430
00:27:32,484 --> 00:27:33,318
Ayos lang.

431
00:27:33,818 --> 00:27:34,653
Oo.

432
00:27:35,862 --> 00:27:39,157
Eto na ulit si Alex Walter,
matapos siyang tumalsik sa round one.

433
00:27:39,240 --> 00:27:41,451
Makakabawi kaya siya sa round two?

434
00:27:43,370 --> 00:27:44,371
Lumabas na siya!

435
00:27:44,871 --> 00:27:46,831
Matibay ang kapit niya.

436
00:27:47,916 --> 00:27:50,043
Nakasakay pa rin si Alex Walter!

437
00:27:50,126 --> 00:27:52,587
Ibang-iba ang performance niya ngayon.

438
00:27:52,671 --> 00:27:56,174
Ang lakas pumiglas ni True North
pero nakakapit pa rin si Alex!

439
00:27:57,092 --> 00:27:58,134
Wow!

440
00:27:58,218 --> 00:28:02,180
Ang lupit no'n.
Palakpakan natin si Alex Walter!

441
00:28:05,266 --> 00:28:08,561
Ang score ni Alex Walter, 81.

442
00:28:13,525 --> 00:28:14,359
Ayos!

443
00:28:17,028 --> 00:28:19,239
Pupuntahan namin siya. Sama ka?

444
00:28:19,322 --> 00:28:22,992
Mag-uusap muna kami ni Grace,
pero be proud sa anak mo.

445
00:28:23,076 --> 00:28:24,119
Ang galing niya.

446
00:28:24,202 --> 00:28:25,662
-Oo.
-Salamat.

447
00:28:25,745 --> 00:28:26,746
Okay, bye.

448
00:28:26,830 --> 00:28:28,373
Okay, bye.

449
00:28:28,456 --> 00:28:29,499
Bye.

450
00:28:32,168 --> 00:28:34,462
Magpupulot na ulit ako ng basura.

451
00:28:35,255 --> 00:28:37,215
Pakisabi kay Alex, congratulations.

452
00:28:37,298 --> 00:28:42,053
-At least may isang successful sa 'tin.
-Di lang siya ang successful sa 'tin.

453
00:28:42,137 --> 00:28:45,265
-Di mo pa kasi nakikita ang SAT scores ko.
-Cole.

454
00:28:45,348 --> 00:28:48,935
Ilang buwan akong nag-aral,
pero di pa rin sapat.

455
00:28:49,018 --> 00:28:51,938
-Mag-SAT ka na lang ulit.
-Ma, pag walang football

456
00:28:52,439 --> 00:28:55,650
o time machine para makabalik
at maiayos 'yong nangyari last year,

457
00:28:55,734 --> 00:29:01,072
malabo akong makapag-college
o magkaroon ng kinabukasan.

458
00:29:02,991 --> 00:29:05,910
Hayaan mo na 'yon.

459
00:29:05,994 --> 00:29:09,581
Pakisabi na lang kay Alex
na proud kaming lahat sa kanya.

460
00:29:11,875 --> 00:29:14,002
Cole, may tanong ako.

461
00:29:15,754 --> 00:29:18,882
Proud ba ako no'ng naging quarterback ka?
Oo naman!

462
00:29:18,965 --> 00:29:22,927
Likas sa 'yo ang pagiging athlete,
at ang pagiging football player.

463
00:29:24,512 --> 00:29:27,849
Pero eto ka ngayon, nagsisimula ulit,

464
00:29:27,932 --> 00:29:28,850
nagsisikap,

465
00:29:28,933 --> 00:29:31,102
sa kabila ng mga pinagdaanan mo,

466
00:29:32,395 --> 00:29:34,522
mas proud ako sa 'yo ngayon.

467
00:29:39,944 --> 00:29:42,030
Yayakapin mo naman siguro ako, 'no?

468
00:29:43,323 --> 00:29:45,700
Mas nakakahiya 'to
kesa sa pamumulot ng basura.

469
00:29:45,784 --> 00:29:47,285
Makinig kang mabuti.

470
00:29:47,368 --> 00:29:50,663
Ano man ang maging direksyon ng buhay mo,

471
00:29:50,747 --> 00:29:55,043
proud na proud kami ng papa mo
na anak ka namin.

472
00:29:56,795 --> 00:29:57,629
Okay?

473
00:29:59,923 --> 00:30:00,799
-Okay?
-Okay.

474
00:30:00,882 --> 00:30:03,176
-Okay.
-Okay.

475
00:30:03,259 --> 00:30:04,385
Ang cute mo.

476
00:30:06,679 --> 00:30:08,765
Sige na, bago pa ulit kita yakapin.

477
00:30:14,854 --> 00:30:15,939
At ngayon,

478
00:30:16,022 --> 00:30:20,318
para sa Saddle Bronc Riding Division
na may 12 kalahok,

479
00:30:20,401 --> 00:30:21,820
eto na ang top five.

480
00:30:21,903 --> 00:30:25,365
Simulan natin sa fifth place,
si Alex Walter!

481
00:30:43,132 --> 00:30:44,551
At ang first place,

482
00:30:44,634 --> 00:30:47,512
na fourth-time winner
ng Dubeau Valley Rodeo,

483
00:30:47,595 --> 00:30:53,560
na may pinakamataas na score,
ang nanalo, si Wylder Holt!

484
00:31:15,665 --> 00:31:17,709
Congratulations, Wylder.

485
00:31:17,792 --> 00:31:18,626
Salamat.

486
00:31:19,252 --> 00:31:21,254
Maganda ang performance mo
sa second round.

487
00:31:21,337 --> 00:31:23,631
Di ka nalaglag. Mahirap 'yong ginawa mo.

488
00:31:24,924 --> 00:31:28,720
Tama nga yata si Blake.
Dapat nga yata akong mag-ingat sa 'yo.

489
00:31:30,054 --> 00:31:31,764
Sa susunod na lang ulit, Alex Walter.

490
00:31:32,932 --> 00:31:34,642
Oo, sa susunod na lang ulit.

491
00:31:38,521 --> 00:31:42,901
Fifth out of 12 ka, maganda ang simula mo.
Ano'ng pakiramdam mo?

492
00:31:45,612 --> 00:31:47,572
Feeling ko nanalo ako.

493
00:31:48,656 --> 00:31:50,783
Dahil sa 'yo kaya ko nagawa 'to.

494
00:31:50,867 --> 00:31:51,868
Alam ko naman.

495
00:31:53,536 --> 00:31:56,080
Kinumusta ka sa 'kin ng tatay ko.

496
00:31:56,164 --> 00:32:00,376
-Okay, ano'ng ibig sabihin no'n?
-Nagso-sponsor ng riders si Papa.

497
00:32:00,460 --> 00:32:03,296
Pag nagalingan siya sa 'yo,
posibleng may future ka dito.

498
00:32:03,379 --> 00:32:06,090
-Talaga?
-Magpapa-tryout siya after few weeks.

499
00:32:06,174 --> 00:32:08,593
Kung interesado ka,
naghahanap siya ng new riders

500
00:32:08,676 --> 00:32:11,763
-na magre-represent ng team niya.
-Wow, ayos 'yon.

501
00:32:11,846 --> 00:32:13,264
Oo, pero mapili siya.

502
00:32:13,348 --> 00:32:16,726
Dapat paghandaan natin 'yon,
pero pwede nating subukan kung gusto mo.

503
00:32:16,809 --> 00:32:18,186
Oo, gusto ko.

504
00:32:18,269 --> 00:32:20,772
Okay, sige. Paghahandaan natin 'yon.

505
00:32:27,946 --> 00:32:28,947
Mauuna na 'ko,

506
00:32:29,030 --> 00:32:32,283
pero ite-text kita tungkol sa practice.

507
00:32:33,201 --> 00:32:34,827
Monday 5:00 a.m.

508
00:32:34,911 --> 00:32:36,454
-Blake.
-Ano 'yon?

509
00:32:36,955 --> 00:32:37,830
Seryoso ako.

510
00:32:39,415 --> 00:32:41,876
Maraming salamat sa lahat ng tulong mo.

511
00:32:43,753 --> 00:32:44,587
Wala 'yon.

512
00:32:59,143 --> 00:32:59,978
Uy!

513
00:33:01,187 --> 00:33:04,148
-Hi.
-Hi. Kanina pa kita hinahanap.

514
00:33:05,149 --> 00:33:09,946
-Ang ganda ng damit mo.
-Sorry. Di ko na po ulit isusuot 'to.

515
00:33:10,697 --> 00:33:11,531
Ang…

516
00:33:12,991 --> 00:33:14,617
Ang ganda mo.

517
00:33:16,369 --> 00:33:17,370
Pero?

518
00:33:18,329 --> 00:33:19,205
Walang pero.

519
00:33:21,249 --> 00:33:25,253
Dapat hayaan na kitang
magdesisyon para sa sarili mo,

520
00:33:25,837 --> 00:33:27,547
sa ayaw at sa gusto ko.

521
00:33:29,340 --> 00:33:31,676
Pero mag-sweater ka bago ka umuwi.

522
00:33:31,759 --> 00:33:33,302
Baka magalit ang papa mo,

523
00:33:33,386 --> 00:33:37,932
mukhang di pa siya ready
sa matured na Grace.

524
00:33:40,935 --> 00:33:42,061
I love you.

525
00:33:42,895 --> 00:33:43,813
I love you too.

526
00:34:03,374 --> 00:34:06,669
Naku po.

527
00:34:06,753 --> 00:34:11,382
Dude, di ko na kayang
magpulot ng hot dog bun nang di ako high.

528
00:34:15,303 --> 00:34:16,554
Malala ang mga tao dito.

529
00:34:17,138 --> 00:34:19,307
Ang lapit-lapit na ng basurahan.

530
00:34:19,390 --> 00:34:20,933
-Bakit ganyan sila?
-Pambihira.

531
00:34:27,774 --> 00:34:32,361
Kung kakalimutan ko 'tong araw na 'to
at magpapaka-high na lang…

532
00:34:33,780 --> 00:34:34,906
Well,

533
00:34:34,989 --> 00:34:38,534
nasa kamay mo ang desisyon, young Jedi.

534
00:34:45,917 --> 00:34:46,751
Ayoko.

535
00:34:48,795 --> 00:34:49,712
Sa 'yo na 'to.

536
00:34:52,006 --> 00:34:52,924
Okay, sige.

537
00:34:54,717 --> 00:34:59,097
Wag kang masyadong magpaka-high,
baka gawin mong meryenda

538
00:34:59,180 --> 00:35:01,307
'yong mga hot dog buns. Okay?

539
00:35:02,683 --> 00:35:05,853
Oo, pero di ako mangangako.

540
00:35:07,688 --> 00:35:08,523
Okay.

541
00:35:19,367 --> 00:35:21,202
-Oh, hi.
-Oh, hi.

542
00:35:21,285 --> 00:35:22,995
-Pa-autograph naman.
-Mama naman.

543
00:35:23,079 --> 00:35:26,124
Big rodeo star ka na.
Di ko alam kung alin mas awkward,

544
00:35:26,207 --> 00:35:30,878
-ang magpa-autograph o yakapin ka.
-Fifth place lang ako. Di po ako champion.

545
00:35:31,379 --> 00:35:32,713
Panalo ka para sa 'kin,

546
00:35:33,214 --> 00:35:36,050
pero ayoko pa ring nakikita kang
nahuhulog sa kabayo.

547
00:35:36,134 --> 00:35:41,139
Well, sorry dahil sabi ni Blake,
gusto yata akong ii-sponsor ng tatay niya.

548
00:35:41,222 --> 00:35:44,308
Pag natuloy 'yon, lagi akong ilalaban.

549
00:35:44,392 --> 00:35:46,644
Ibig sabihin…

550
00:35:47,145 --> 00:35:50,106
Lagi mo akong makikitang
mahulog sa kabayo.

551
00:35:50,189 --> 00:35:52,275
-Opo.
-Pero di na sa kabayong 'yon?

552
00:35:52,358 --> 00:35:53,860
-Nakakatakot 'yon.
-Di na.

553
00:35:53,943 --> 00:35:55,403
-Nakakaloka 'yon.
-Kaya nga po.

554
00:35:55,486 --> 00:35:56,988
-Nakakatakot 'yon.
-Totoo.

555
00:35:59,574 --> 00:36:01,325
Ang astig mo kanina sa arena.

556
00:36:03,119 --> 00:36:04,871
Kinabahan ako…

557
00:36:06,247 --> 00:36:08,916
pero masaya akong
ginagawa mo 'yong hilig mo.

558
00:36:09,542 --> 00:36:10,376
Halata naman.

559
00:36:12,628 --> 00:36:14,422
Pa-hug po ako.

560
00:36:16,799 --> 00:36:18,593
-I love you.
-I love you too.

561
00:36:22,096 --> 00:36:23,890
-Salamat sa pagpunta.
-Anytime.

562
00:36:25,057 --> 00:36:26,100
Ano'ng problema?

563
00:36:27,643 --> 00:36:30,521
Tinakot ako ni Richard.
Siya na ang masusunod sa ranch project.

564
00:36:30,605 --> 00:36:32,773
Ano'ng maitutulong ko?

565
00:36:34,025 --> 00:36:36,736
May nakita akong vine,
no'ng hinahanap ko si Murphy.

566
00:36:37,278 --> 00:36:40,114
Nalaman kong may vineyard do'n noon,

567
00:36:40,198 --> 00:36:42,742
na maganda raw ayon sa mga nabasa ko.

568
00:36:44,285 --> 00:36:45,578
Okay, so ano'ng plano?

569
00:36:45,661 --> 00:36:48,539
Naggo-golf pa ba kayo
ni Victoria Chase ng Little Cap Winery?

570
00:36:48,623 --> 00:36:49,749
Oo.

571
00:36:49,832 --> 00:36:51,626
Gusto ko sana siyang makausap.

572
00:36:52,543 --> 00:36:53,794
Ako'ng bahala diyan.

573
00:36:54,712 --> 00:36:55,922
Salamat, pare.

574
00:36:57,048 --> 00:36:58,549
Salamat, sumama ka.

575
00:36:58,633 --> 00:37:00,468
Ang sarap no'ng donuts.

576
00:37:00,551 --> 00:37:01,677
Kaya nga!

577
00:37:02,929 --> 00:37:05,723
-Ang saya. Eto mismo ang kailangan ko.
-Oo nga.

578
00:37:08,309 --> 00:37:09,810
Hihintayin ka namin sa kotse.

579
00:37:13,105 --> 00:37:14,190
Napanood mo ba si Alex?

580
00:37:14,273 --> 00:37:17,026
Nag-alala ako no'ng nahulog siya,
pero nakatayo naman siya.

581
00:37:17,610 --> 00:37:20,529
Well, gano'n talaga kami,

582
00:37:21,030 --> 00:37:24,116
pag bumagsak, bumabangon ulit.

583
00:37:25,368 --> 00:37:27,286
Rodeo pa ba ang pinag-uusapan natin?

584
00:37:29,163 --> 00:37:32,124
-Natanggap ko na 'yong SAT scores ko.
-Tapos?

585
00:37:34,126 --> 00:37:37,546
Di naman lahat ng universities
sa SAT scores bumabase.

586
00:37:37,630 --> 00:37:40,967
Oo, pero ang laki ng binaba ng GPA ko
simula last year.

587
00:37:41,050 --> 00:37:43,678
-Nakatulong ba ang summer school?
-Di pa rin sapat.

588
00:37:44,303 --> 00:37:45,429
Eh kung tulungan kita?

589
00:37:47,181 --> 00:37:51,185
Forte ko 'to.
Kaya kitang gawan ng study planner

590
00:37:51,269 --> 00:37:52,603
para sa SAT retake mo,

591
00:37:52,687 --> 00:37:55,731
tapos sabay tayong
mag-fill out ng applications.

592
00:37:55,815 --> 00:37:58,109
Makakapag-college ka. Promise.

593
00:37:58,693 --> 00:38:02,738
-Gusto mo na talaga akong umalis, 'no?
-Di naman sa gano'n…

594
00:38:04,615 --> 00:38:06,534
Gusto lang kitang maging masaya.

595
00:38:09,161 --> 00:38:09,996
Alam ko naman.

596
00:38:11,539 --> 00:38:12,456
Thank you.

597
00:38:12,540 --> 00:38:15,501
Welcome sa Jackie Howard College Bootcamp.

598
00:38:17,628 --> 00:38:19,297
Jackie, nga pala.

599
00:38:20,089 --> 00:38:22,091
Pwede bang sa 'tin lang muna 'to?

600
00:38:22,675 --> 00:38:24,927
Nakakapagod na kasing mag-fail,

601
00:38:25,011 --> 00:38:27,763
palagi na lang akong dapat tulungan.

602
00:38:28,347 --> 00:38:30,516
Pwedeng i-secret na lang natin 'to?

603
00:38:35,980 --> 00:38:37,148
Oo naman.

604
00:38:38,858 --> 00:38:40,026
Sa 'tin lang 'yon.

605
00:38:58,669 --> 00:39:01,047
-Hi.
-Hi.

606
00:39:01,130 --> 00:39:05,051
Di ko pa ulit 'to napapasok
mula no'ng nag-share kayo dito ni Cole.

607
00:39:05,134 --> 00:39:09,430
Oo, ang bait niya nga, eh,
pumayag siyang mag-share kami.

608
00:39:10,556 --> 00:39:12,224
Dapat pasalamatan ko siya.

609
00:39:13,434 --> 00:39:15,019
Well, kayong dalawa.

610
00:39:15,102 --> 00:39:16,312
Bakit ako?

611
00:39:16,395 --> 00:39:17,396
Kasi

612
00:39:18,147 --> 00:39:20,775
dahil sa 'yo kaya maganda
ang performance ko.

613
00:39:21,525 --> 00:39:23,277
Di 'yan totoo.

614
00:39:23,361 --> 00:39:27,365
Sinabi ko lang namang magtiwala ka
sa sarili mo. Likas ka nang magaling.

615
00:39:28,240 --> 00:39:31,494
Pero no'ng personal kong
napanood ang performance mo,

616
00:39:32,453 --> 00:39:34,538
habang ginagawa mo 'yong hilig mo…

617
00:39:36,082 --> 00:39:39,418
Ibang klase 'yon,
at ang saya sa pakiramdam.

618
00:39:39,502 --> 00:39:41,337
Ikaw ang nagpapasaya sa 'kin.

619
00:39:44,298 --> 00:39:49,053
-Nangako tayong di na natin uulitin 'yon.
-Oo.

620
00:39:49,804 --> 00:39:53,599
Iniiwasan nating
maging malapit sa isa't isa,

621
00:39:53,682 --> 00:39:56,227
pero di ko sure kung bakit.

622
00:39:57,061 --> 00:39:58,521
Alam mo kung bakit.

623
00:39:58,604 --> 00:40:00,856
It's complicated.

624
00:40:00,940 --> 00:40:02,233
Para sa 'kin, hindi.

625
00:40:03,943 --> 00:40:08,155
Alam kong sinabi kong
kailangan ko ng space,

626
00:40:08,989 --> 00:40:10,991
pero ang totoo, di ako masaya noon.

627
00:40:11,575 --> 00:40:12,785
Di ako masaya ngayon.

628
00:40:13,285 --> 00:40:15,162
Gusto kitang makasama, Jackie.

629
00:40:16,789 --> 00:40:19,959
Pero pagkatapos ng mga nangyari…

630
00:40:20,042 --> 00:40:23,629
Okay. Tama ka. Medyo komplikado nga.

631
00:40:26,132 --> 00:40:27,967
Eh kung ilihim natin?

632
00:40:29,718 --> 00:40:32,721
Ilihim natin hangga't di pa tayo sure.
Sa ngayon,

633
00:40:33,556 --> 00:40:34,682
sa 'tin lang muna 'to.

634
00:40:38,602 --> 00:40:39,437
Sige.

635
00:40:40,229 --> 00:40:41,188
Okay.

636
00:40:41,689 --> 00:40:42,731
Sa 'tin lang 'to.

